<title>MALAYSIA: Uniphone Telecom year net down 63.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Uniphone Telecom year net down 63.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan. 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  5.46	 vs	 14.86</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 3.91	 vs	 10.64</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   17.59	 vs	 32.08</p>
<p>    Minorities less	   1.57	 vs less   4.62</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   nil	  vs add   35.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		  542.22	 vs	650.45</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	4.0	  vs	  4.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Uniphone Telecommunications Bhd operates coin and card payphones.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
